{"created": "2026-10-02T11:50:59.936020+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-02T15:12:21.689671+00:00", "id": 23102045, "conceptrecid": "23088601", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23088601", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "metadata": {"title": "Sign-Quotiented Doubling Modulo n: Cycle Structure, 2-Adic Synchronization, Lifting, and Forward-Closed Subsets \u2014 Four Working Papers", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "publication_date": "2026-10-02", "description": "<p><span>&lt;p&gt;Multiplication by 2 on Z/nZ after identifying x with &minus;x, studied for every n. Write n = 2^s m with m odd and r(d) = min{r &ge; 1 : 2^r &equiv; &plusmn;1 mod d}.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I. Cycle structure.&lt;/strong&gt; For odd n the map is a permutation; its cycles are one fixed point and, for each divisor d &amp;gt; 1, &phi;(d)/(2r(d)) cycles of length r(d). &lt;strong&gt;II. 2-adic synchronization.&lt;/strong&gt; r(d) = ord_d(2)/2 exactly when all v2(ord of 2 modulo the prime-power factors) are equal and positive; the criterion depends only on the prime divisors. &lt;strong&gt;III. 2-adic lifting.&lt;/strong&gt; The full functional graph: G_{2^s m}&nbsp;</span><span>&cong;</span><span> Lift_s(G_m) &mdash; the odd part gives the cycle core, the factor 2^s universal rooted trees; the subsets of the complete binary layer closed toward the root are the plane binary trees, with B_0 = x, B_{h+1} = x(1 + B_h)^2. &lt;strong&gt;IV. Forward-closed subsets.&lt;/strong&gt; The polynomial P_n(x) counting subsets S with D(S) </span><span>&sube;</span><span> S factorises as (1 + Z_s(x)) &prod;_{d | m, d &amp;gt; 1} (1 + T_s(x)^{r(d)})^{&phi;(d)/(2r(d))}; P_n(1), for n = 1..200, is given in the dataset doi:10.5281/zenodo.22991226.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prior work (version 1.1.0).&lt;/strong&gt; Sign-quotiented doubling is the Chebyshev map T&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; in disguise (x = y + 1/y). The structure of papers I and III is known for the cyclic groups of orders p &plusmn; 1 (Vasiga&ndash;Shallit 2004) and q &plusmn; 1 (Qureshi&ndash;Panario 2019); it is given here for every modulus, with self-contained proofs and no claim of priority. The criterion of paper II is very probably classical. The enumeration of forward-closed subsets (paper IV) appears to be new.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working manuscripts. Papers I&ndash;II are at version 3, III&ndash;IV at version 4. The study of the coefficients of N_h = B_h &minus; B_{h&minus;1} (exact height) is a separate working preprint, not included. Two scripts check the structure and the factorisation for 1 &le; n &le; 200 (0 mismatch); the CSV of P_n(1) is included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This doubling generates the vocabulary of axes of La Livr&eacute;e d'Herm&egrave;s; the case n = 12 is Theorem 8 of the companion note doi:10.5281/zenodo.22965031.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Licences.&lt;/strong&gt; Texts: CC BY 4.0. Code: AGPL v3; commercial licence on request.&lt;/p&gt;</span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Amiot, Anibal Edelberto", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0002-6414-9448"}], "keywords": ["doubling map", "multiplicative order", "functional graphs", "2-adic valuation", "Chebyshev polynomials", "forward-closed subsets", "generating polynomials", "integer sequences"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22965031", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22991226", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1016/S0012-365X(03)00158-4", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1007/s10623-018-0545-7", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.1.1", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "alternate_identifiers": [{"identifier": "Q141191562"}], "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23088601"}}]}, "notes": "<p><span>Code under AGPL v3. Commercial licence: anibaledel@gmail.com</span></p>"}, "title": "Sign-Quotiented Doubling Modulo n: Cycle Structure, 2-Adic Synchronization, Lifting, and Forward-Closed Subsets \u2014 Four Working Papers", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23102045", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23102045", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23102045?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23102045", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23102045/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23088601", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23088601", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23088601", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23088601", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23102045/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23102045/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23102045:03_2adic_lifting.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}